        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "A significant part of our growth strategy is based upon our belief that our customers will increasingly value data delivered to them from our extensive portfolio of products which we are continuing to make further developments in this area.",
        "start_character": 42205,
        "end_character": 42445
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-011890",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-011890-c00341c7398e0e6a",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-011890",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we manufacture structures with integrated intelligence and electronics such as streetlighting, cell towers and energy infrastructure products for Smart Cities (the interconnected physical and digital elements within a city that utilize technology to enhance efficiency, sustainability, and quality of life for residents).",
        "start_character": 794,
        "end_character": 1129
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-011890",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-011890-c00341c7398e0e6a",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-011890",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In Europe we own a 450,000 square foot office and manufacturing facility in Kraljevo, Serbia on 6 acres of land that has adequate space and capacity to manufacture their legacy product offerings as well as EV ARC™s and our other products as needed for the European market.",
        "start_character": 69736,
        "end_character": 70008
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-011890",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-011890-c00341c7398e0e6a",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-011890",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In October 2023, Beam acquired Amiga DOO Kraljevo (“Amiga”) which we renamed Beam Europe following the acquisition, is a business located in Serbia and engaged in the manufacture and distribution of steel structures with electronic integration, such as streetlights, cell towers, and transportation portals.",
        "start_character": 30688,
        "end_character": 30995
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-011890",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-011890-c00341c7398e0e6a",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-011890",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Since the fourth quarter of 2023, we have been selling our products in the European market with, for example, sales of EV ARCs™ to the British Army in Cyprus and the deployment of a sponsored network of EV ARCs™ at the Belgrade International Airport.",
        "start_character": 40087,
        "end_character": 40337
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-011890",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-011890-c00341c7398e0e6a",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-011890",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The cost and complexity to deploy our products will not increase and in fact, we believe that, like any other manufacturing company, our costs will decrease while our efficiency and deployment velocity increases.",
        "start_character": 65264,
        "end_character": 65476
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-011890",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-011890-c00341c7398e0e6a",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-011890",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The external resources which we have engaged have established track records and relevant experience in selling infrastructure products to the types of customers with whom we have had success historically.",
        "start_character": 50841,
        "end_character": 51045
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-011890",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-011890-c00341c7398e0e6a",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-011890",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also acquired relationships with existing customers to whom we are now able to sell our portfolio innovative energy, mobility and transportation infrastructure products as well as our other Smart Cities products.",
        "start_character": 4731,
        "end_character": 4946
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-011890",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-011890-c00341c7398e0e6a",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-011890",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also lease a 37,800 square foot facility in Broadview, Illinois, where we produce our energy storage products for our own products and for a variety of other customers who need energy storage solutions.",
        "start_character": 69509,
        "end_character": 69714
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-011890",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-011890-c00341c7398e0e6a",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-011890",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are agnostic to the EV charging service equipment as we do not sell EV charging, rather we sell products which enable it.",
        "start_character": 4269,
        "end_character": 4393
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-011890",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-011890-c00341c7398e0e6a",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-011890",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-09",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are in contact with all these companies and have observed that none of them have a product which provides all the same value and differentiation that our energy security products deliver because our systems are transportable, rapidly deployed and offer multiple layers of value.",
        "start_character": 62972,
        "end_character": 63253
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-011890",
